Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add Discord bridge Lua hooks and read-only request
 handlers

Game-Chat[EN-US] relay (talkEvent on channel 7), confirmed catch events, shiny and
legendary spawn events (spawn system, scripts, fishing, headbutt), GM broadcast and
shutdown warnings, and read-only trainer/pokemon/server lookups. All hooks are
pcall-guarded and inactive while the bridge is disabled.
